# Takuto+ design rules

Tone: tech chic. Calm, precise, cool. References: Apple TV+ restraint, Linear hierarchy, a printed racing race card.

## Color
- Surfaces: `--bg #05060a`, `--bg-soft #0a0c12`, ink `#f4f6fb`, muted `--ink-60` / `--ink-40`, hairlines `--line` / `--line-strong`.
- One accent per screen: the current profile's accent (`catalog.js` → `profiles[id].accent`), set as `--pc`.
- Profile accents are soft pastels that read on dark: lavender `#b7a6f5`, butter `#f0c96b`, sky `#8fb3ee`, sage `#9fd39a`.
- Title accents are silks colors and only appear on Race Day, where six lanes need six colors.
- Never: Netflix red/green, warm cream text, gold, gradients layered on gradients.

## Who's watching (the one warm moment)
- The opening picker is a desk scene: polaroids taped to a dark wall, illustrated personas, handwritten labels (`--font-hand`, Caveat), stickers, and ink doodles.
- Polaroids use paper `#f6f1e7`, 3px corners, a tape strip, and a slight tilt that straightens on hover.
- Profile pastels (lavender, butter, sky, sage) live in `catalog.js` as `accent` and `tint`. Everything after the picker returns to the quiet streaming style.

## Shape and spacing
- Radii: `12px` for cards, tiles, inputs, dialogs; `999px` for buttons and dots; `3px` for polaroids only.
- 8px spacing grid. One card size per grid; grids never scroll horizontally.

## Type
- Inter for UI. Instrument Serif for numerals (race numbers, stats, results) and at most one italic accent word per heading.
- Small caps style for meta: 11px, 600, `letter-spacing: .16em`, uppercase, `--ink-40`.
- Numbers use `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`.

## Components
- One `.btn-primary` per view. Secondary actions are `.tp-link` text buttons or `.btn-ghost`.
- Icons are inline SVG with `stroke="currentColor"`. No emoji, no text glyphs (‹ › ▶ ← 🏇) as icons.
- Project art is the logo filling its panel edge to edge: the panel uses the logo's own background (`logoBg`) and `logoZoom` trims the file's padding. Without a logo, a white wordmark sits on `logoBg`. Never a logo inside a smaller white box.
- Every card shows: race number, name, role · years, and one headline stat (`stats[0]`).
- Lists of results are ruled rows (hairline between rows), not boxed cards.

## Code
- Visitor text goes in with `textContent`, never `innerHTML`. Static SVG strings from this repo may use a `<template>`.
- Every motion respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Check 390px and desktop before calling a change done.

```css
/* ✅ */ .tp-card { border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
/* ❌ */ .tp-card { border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 3px solid red; }
```
